     If[0m[2m already[0m[2m charged[0m[2m, `[0m[2mcharged =[0m[2m True`,[0m[2m so we[0m[2m don't increment[0m[2m back.[0m[2m The[0m[2m checkout returns[0m[2m `True[0m[2m`.[0m[2m
     
     But if[0m[2m this[0m[2m is a[0m[2m duplicate checkout[0m[2m ([0m[2msame `[0m[2morder_id[0m[2m` called[0m[2m again),[0m[2m and the[0m[2m first one[0m[2m already[0m[2m decremented[0m[2m inventory and[0m[2m succeeded[0m[2m, the[0m[2m second one[0m[2m would decrement[0m[2m AGAIN[0m[2m (if[0m[2m stock available[0m[2m), then[0m[2m charge returns[0m[2m True[0m[2m, and[0m[2m we'd[0m[2m return True[0m[2m without increment[0m[2ming back[0m[2m. Double[0m[2m delivery![0m[2m
     
     So[0m[2m with[0m[2m the[0m[2m simple approach[0m[2m, `[0m[2mcharge`[0m[2m MUST return[0m[2m `False[0m[2m` for[0m[2m duplicates to[0m[2m prevent double[0m[2m delivery[0m[2m.
     
