     OK[0m[2m, I'll[0m[2m go with[0m[2m `[0m[2mcharge`[0m[2m returning `[0m[2mFalse`[0m[2m for duplicates[0m[2m. It's[0m[2m the safest[0m[2m choice for[0m[2m the simple[0m[2m decrement-first[0m[2m approach.[0m[2m
     
     Wait[0m[2m, actually[0m[2m,[0m[2m there's[0m[2m another option[0m[2m. What[0m[2m if I[0m[2m pass[0m[2m `order[0m[2m_id`[0m[2m to `[0m[2mdecrement[0m[2m`?[0m[2m But that[0m[2m changes the[0m[2m public interface[0m[2m of `[0m[2mInventory[0m[2m.de[0m[2mcrement`,[0m[2m which I'm[0m[2m told[0m[2m not to[0m[2m do.[0m[2m
     
     What[0m[2m if I[0m[2m add a[0m[2m new method[0m[2m `[0m[2mde[0m[2mcrement_for[0m[2m_order(self[0m[2m, order[0m[2m_id:[0m[2m str,[0m[2m quantity:[0m[2m int)[0m[2m -> bool[0m[2m` that[0m[2m is id[0m[2mempotent?[0m[2m Then in[0m[2m `checkout[0m[2m.py[0m[2m`, I[0m[2m use that[0m[2m instead[0m[2m of `[0m[2mdecrement[0m[2m`. This[0m[2m doesn't[0m[2m change the[0m[2m public interface[0m[2m of existing[0m[2m methods.[0m[2m
     
     Let[0m[2m me design[0m[2m this:[0m[2m
     
