     This is[0m[2m clean[0m[2m, simple[0m[2m, and[0m[2m fixes[0m[2m the simulation[0m[2m. Let[0m[2m me think[0m[2m about whether[0m[2m it satisfies[0m[2m all requirements[0m[2m:
     
     1[0m[2m. **[0m[2mInventory never[0m[2m goes below[0m[2m zero**:[0m[2m `de[0m[2mcrement`[0m[2m is now[0m[2m atomic with[0m[2m a lock[0m[2m. Two[0m[2m concurrent decre[0m[2mments can't[0m[2m both see[0m[2m stock[0m[2m >=[0m[2m 1 and[0m[2m decrement.[0m[2m One[0m[2m will[0m[2m get[0m[2m the lock[0m[2m first,[0m[2m decrement,[0m[2m then the[0m[2m second[0m[2m will[0m[2m see stock[0m[2m =[0m[2m 0[0m[2m and return[0m[2m False.[0m[2m ✓[0m[2m
     
