     2[0m[2m. Second[0m[2m: decrement[0m[2m (s[0m[2mucceeds[0m[2m, if[0m[2m stock available[0m[2m), charge[0m[2m (duplicate[0m[2m, fails[0m[2m), increment[0m[2m back[0m[2m,[0m[2m FAIL[0m[2m
     
