     2.[0m[2m Second:[0m[2m decrement ([0m[2msucceed[0m[2ms,[0m[2m if stock[0m[2m available),[0m[2m charge ([0m[2mduplicate,[0m[2m fails),[0m[2m increment back[0m[2m, FAIL[0m[2m
     
