  Fixed[0m[2m the[0m[2m three race[0m[2m conditions across[0m[2m 10[0m[2m simulation[0m[2m runs with[0m[2m zero errors[0m[2m.
     
     **[0m[2mRoot causes[0m[2m identified[0m[2m:**
     
     1[0m[2m. **[0m[2mOvers[0m[2melling ([0m[2mTOCT[0m[2mOU race[0m[2m)**[0m[2m —[0m[2m `checkout[0m[2m.py`[0m[2m called[0m[2m `check[0m[2m_stock`,[0m[2m then `[0m[2mcharge[0m[2m`, then[0m[2m `de[0m[2mcrement`.[0m[2m Between those[0m[2m awaits[0m[2m, other[0m[2m tasks[0m[2m could inter[0m[2mleave[0m[2m and decrement[0m[2m stock[0m[2m, causing[0m[2m `de[0m[2mcrement`[0m[2m to make[0m[2m inventory negative[0m[2m.
     2[0m[2m. **[0m[2mGhost charges[0m[2m** —[0m[2m If[0m[2m `[0m[2mcharge[0m[2m` succeeded[0m[2m but `[0m[2mdecrement[0m[2m` then[0m[2m failed ([0m[2mbecause stock[0m[2m ran[0m[2m out between[0m[2m the[0m[2m earlier[0m[2m `[0m[2mcheck_stock[0m[2m` and[0m[2m now[0m[2m), the[0m[2m customer was[0m[2m charged[0m[2m with[0m[2m no delivery[0m[2m and[0m[2m no successful[0m[2m order record[0m[2m.
     3[0m[2m. **[0m[2mDuplicate charges[0m[2m** —[0m[2m `Payment[0m[2mGateway`[0m[2m had no[0m[2m guard[0m[2m against[0m[2m charging[0m[2m the same[0m[2m `order[0m[2m_id`[0m[2m twice[0m[2m.
     
     **[0m[2mChanges made[0m[2m:**
     
